<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Example</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="2293.23" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 676.77 2293.23" width="676.77"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,2293.23) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 7.15 L 0 2286.08 C 0 2290.03 3.2 2293.23 7.15 2293.23 L 669.62 2293.23 C 673.57 2293.23 676.77 2290.03 676.77 2286.08 L 676.77 7.15 C 676.77 3.2 673.57 0 669.62 0 L 7.15 0 C 3.2 0 0 3.2 0 7.15 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.25 7.15 L 1.25 2270.57 L 675.53 2270.57 L 675.53 7.15 C 675.53 3.89 672.88 1.25 669.62 1.25 L 7.15 1.25 C 3.89 1.25 1.25 3.89 1.25 7.15 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.09 2278.44)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:47.31em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="654.64"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:47.31em;">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Example of interleaved tool plan output and MAM evaluation.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.09 900.99)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:55.66em;--ltx-fo-height:98.27em;--ltx-fo-depth:64.31em;font-size:10pt;" height="2249.67" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1359.75)" width="770.18"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:55.66em;">
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Query:<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> This lake looks really familiar, I think I saw it in an anime. Can you tell me more about it? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span><img src="2603.29902v1/figures/oven_04951919.jpg" id="A4.p1.pic1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:294/221;" width="294" height="221" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Context Documents (Abridged):<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Lake Suwa is a lake in the Kiso Mountains, central Nagano Prefecture, Japan. It is the site of a natural phenomenon known as "Omiwatari" (ice pressure ridges). Cultural history: Hokusai included it in <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji</span>. Popular culture: In <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">"Your Name"</span>, the town of Itomori was modeled after Lake Suwa. Mentioned in <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Rurouni Kenshin</span>, <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Blood-C</span>, and Kurosawa’s <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Kagemusha</span>.</span></span></span><img src="2603.29902v1/figures/Q1206692.jpg" id="A4.p1.pic1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:294/195;" width="294" height="195" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model Response:<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">The lake you are looking at is </span>Lake Suwa<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (Suwa-ko), located in the Kiso Mountains of central Nagano Prefecture, Japan. It is the largest lake in the prefecture and serves as the source of the Tenryū River.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#1F77B4;">&lt;tool&gt;{"tool_name": "reference", "description": "A wide view of Lake Suwa showing the surrounding town and mountains.", "params": {"img_index": 0}}&lt;/tool&gt;<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You likely recognize it because it served as the real-world inspiration for the fictional town of Itomori in the blockbuster anime movie <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">"Your Name" (Kimi no Na wa)</span>. The distinct topography of the lake, surrounded by mountains and the cityscape hugging the shoreline, strongly resembles the setting where the protagonist Mitsuha lives. This connection has turned Lake Suwa into a major pilgrimage site for anime fans.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#1F77B4;">&lt;tool&gt;{"tool_name": "search", "description": "Comparison of Lake Suwa and Itomori from Your Name anime", "params": {"query": "Lake Suwa vs Itomori Your Name comparison"}}&lt;/tool&gt;<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Geography and Legend: The "Omiwatari"<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Beyond its anime fame, Lake Suwa is known for a rare natural phenomenon called </span>Omiwatari<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.7.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (The God’s Crossing). Because the lake is shallow, it freezes quickly in winter. When the temperature drops significantly, the ice contracts and cracks, creating pressure ridges that can reach 30 cm or more in height.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#1F77B4;">&lt;tool&gt;{"tool_name": "search", "description": "Omiwatari phenomenon on Lake Suwa ice ridge", "params": {"query": "Omiwatari Lake Suwa ice ridge"}}&lt;/tool&gt;<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">According to local Shinto folklore, these ridges are formed by the god Takeminakata-no-kami crossing the frozen lake to visit his wife, the goddess Yasakatome-no-kami. This crossing has been recorded by Shinto priests for centuries, making it the <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">oldest-known human-observed climate record</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Other Pop Culture Appearances<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">While "Your Name" is its most famous recent appearance, Lake Suwa has a deep history in Japanese media, including <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Rurouni Kenshin</span>, <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Blood-C</span>, and <span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Kagemusha</span>. The lake is also home to the </span>Suwa Grand Shrine<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.10.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">, which hosts the famous Onbashira festival.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#1F77B4;">&lt;tool&gt;{"tool_name": "search", "description": "Suwa Grand Shrine and Onbashira festival", "params": {"query": "Suwa Grand Shrine Onbashira festival"}}&lt;/tool&gt;<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">

</span></span></span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#000000;display:inline-block;"> </span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Multi-Agent Evaluation:<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:89%;">Agent 1: Precision Report<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.12.1.2.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool 1 (Reference):</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Necessity:</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. Augments visual info via elevated perspective. </span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool Choice:</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. </span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Scores: 1b: 2, 1c: 2, 2b: 0, 2c: 2]</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">. </span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Critique:</span><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Failed 2b (Choice/Params) due to incorrect index.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool 2 (Search):</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Necessity:</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. Clearer explanation via side-by-side comparison. </span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool Choice:</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. </span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Scores: 1b: 2, 1c: 2, 2b: 2, 2c: 2]</span><span id="A4.I1.i2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool 3 (Search):</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Necessity:</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. Visualizing the specific ice ridge phenomenon. </span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool Choice:</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. </span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Scores: 1b: 2, 1c: 2, 2b: 2, 2c: 2]</span><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool 4 (Search):</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Necessity:</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. Visualizing cultural festival activities. </span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tool Choise:</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Pass. </span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[Scores: 1b: 2, 1c: 2, 2b: 2, 2c: 2]</span><span id="A4.I1.i4.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Agent 2: Recall Report<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.I2" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A4.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Missed Opportunities:</span><span id="A4.I2.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> None. The model successfully identified and called tools for all major visual subjects mentioned in the text.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Missed Count:</span><span id="A4.I2.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 0.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Agent 3: Chief Judge Summary<span id="A4.p1.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A4.I3" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<span id="A4.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Precision Summary:</span><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Agent 1 found 4 tools; all were necessary. However, Tool 1 had an incorrect parameter (</span><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">img_index: 0</span><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> instead of the defined image index </span><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">IMG#1-1</span><span id="A4.I3.i1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Recall Summary:</span><span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> No missed opportunities. Complete coverage of visual subjects.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Global Pacing:</span><span id="A4.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Excellent. The model interleaves images perfectly with relevant sections (anime comparison, Omiwatari, festival).</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Justification &amp; Final Score:</span><span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Score: 80/100</span><span id="A4.I3.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">. The response is almost perfect in identification and pacing. The only flaw is a single, non-critical parameter error in the first tool call, which brings the score into the 80-band.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
